  "metadata": {
    "name": "Aslan Border Clash",
    "owner": "dcsturman@gmail.com",
    "description": "An Aslan raiding squadron, two Halaheike pocket warships and four Ekawsiykua escorts with eight light fighters formed up 2,000 km ahead, meets an Imperial force of two Chrysanthemum destroyer escorts, four Dragon system defence boats and four Type T patrol corvettes. Open space; the battle lines start 30,000 km apart, at rest, in line abreast. For training a network on fights larger than eight ships a side."
